<title>SPAIN: Spain's BBV '96 attributable rises 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's BBV '96 attributable rises 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996 profits for Spanish banking group Banco Bilbao Vizcaya</p>
<p>(billion pesetas, unless stated)</p>
<p> Net attributable profit/loss     104.26 vs 84.01</p>
<p> Net interest income		  415.57 vs 343.27</p>
<p> Ordinary profit			586.87 vs 474. 57</p>
<p> Financial/trading profit	     37.79 vs 10.88</p>
<p> Operating profit		     222.30  vs 160.13</p>
